{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full","toc":false},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <h1>Turning public data<br>into economic insight</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">\n    I'm <strong>Tanise Brandão</strong>, an economist and data scientist based in Brazil.\n    I work at the intersection of <em>causal inference, machine learning, and public policy</em> —\n    using open data to understand how economies and institutions actually work.\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Econometrics</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Causal Inference</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Macroeconomics</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Python · R</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Public Policy</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"projects/index.html\" class=\"btn-primary-custom\">View Projects</a>\n  <a href=\"about.html\" class=\"btn-outline-custom\">About me</a>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">Featured Projects</p>\n\n<div class=\"project-grid\">\n\n  <a href=\"projects/nowcasting.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"card-label\">Macroeconomics · ML</div>\n      <span class=\"card-status status-wip\">In progress</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3>Nowcasting Brazilian Inflation with Machine Learning</h3>\n    <p>Can we predict IPCA before the official release? A comparison of LASSO, XGBoost, and AR benchmarks using BCB and Google Trends data.</p>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Python</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">XGBoost</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">BCB API</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Time Series</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"projects/index.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"card-label\">Causal Inference</div>\n      <span class=\"card-status status-wip\">Coming soon</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3>Evaluating a Social Policy with Synthetic Control</h3>\n    <p>Estimating the causal effect of a federal transfer program on local outcomes using the Synthetic Control Method on Brazilian municipal data.</p>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Python</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Synthetic Control</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">IBGE data</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"projects/index.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"card-label\">Labor Economics</div>\n      <span class=\"card-status status-wip\">Coming soon</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3>Gender Pay Gap in Brazil's Formal Labor Market</h3>\n    <p>Tracking the evolution of gender wage gaps by sector from 2010 to 2023 using RAIS — one of the richest employer-employee datasets in the world.</p>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Python</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">RAIS</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Oaxaca-Blinder</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"projects/index.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"card-label\">Data Product</div>\n      <span class=\"card-status status-wip\">Coming soon</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3>Brazil Macro Monitor</h3>\n    <p>A live dashboard tracking SELIC, inflation, exchange rate, and fiscal data via the Banco Central API. Built with Streamlit and updated daily.</p>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Python</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Streamlit</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">BCB API</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Plotly</span>\n  </a>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">Em Português</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 620px;\">\n  Sou economista com doutorado em Economia pela PUCRS, com passagem por UFMG e UFRGS.\n  Trabalho com métodos quantitativos aplicados a políticas públicas, com foco em\n  econometria, inferência causal e aprendizado de máquina.\n  Este portfólio reúne projetos de dados que desenvolvo de forma independente,\n  sempre com código aberto e dados públicos.\n</p>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"hero\">\n  <h1>Turning public data<br>into economic insight</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">\n    I'm <strong>Tanise Brandão</strong>, an economist and data scientist based in Brazil.\n    I work at the intersection of <em>causal inference, machine learning, and public policy</em> —\n    using open data to understand how economies and institutions actually work.\n  </p>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n    <span class=\"tag\">Econometrics</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Causal Inference</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Macroeconomics</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Python · R</span>\n    <span class=\"tag\">Public Policy</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"projects/index.html\" class=\"btn-primary-custom\">View Projects</a>\n  <a href=\"about.html\" class=\"btn-outline-custom\">About me</a>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">Featured Projects</p>\n\n<div class=\"project-grid\">\n\n  <a href=\"projects/nowcasting.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"card-label\">Macroeconomics · ML</div>\n      <span class=\"card-status status-wip\">In progress</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3>Nowcasting Brazilian Inflation with Machine Learning</h3>\n    <p>Can we predict IPCA before the official release? A comparison of LASSO, XGBoost, and AR benchmarks using BCB and Google Trends data.</p>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Python</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">XGBoost</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">BCB API</span>\n    <span class=\"tech-tag\">Time Series</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"projects/index.html\" class=\"project-card\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start;\">\n      <di